# Clan d’Estain — Chronique Interactive
## Master Prompt Context

This file defines the narrative and structural goals of the project.

Codex must follow AGENTS.md strictly.

---

# 🎯 PROJECT VISION

Create a narrative point & click + parser adventure game adapting the real Tyranny of Dragons campaign played by the Clan d’Estain.

The game must:
- Be faithful to the real campaign logs.
- Support canonical and “what if” divergences.
- Use Mode A (unified group control).
- Allow permanent death.
- Support replacement characters.
- Include serious and silly Game Over states.
- Implement rollback to last decision checkpoint.

The canonical timeline must always remain reachable.

---

# 📚 SOURCE MATERIAL

Primary sources:
- JDR DD5 2023 journal
- Character sheets (Bjolnir, Darrin, Ellyjobell, Kairon, Malar, etc.)
- Tyranny of Dragons official module

Do NOT invent canonical names if present in logs.

If data is missing, list assumptions explicitly.

